# Everything under java-upgrade is generated scratch except the two hand-written
# hook scripts, which are kept in Git for review.
**

# A file cannot be re-included while one of its parent directories is excluded,
# so the two directories on the path have to be un-ignored first.
!hooks/
!hooks/scripts/

!hooks/scripts/recordToolUse.ps1
!hooks/scripts/recordToolUse.sh